    stateOfArt: ["FIRM-ACT gave the disease its only randomised first-line standard.", "Controlling cortisol excess is as important as controlling the tumour.", "Immunotherapy helps a minority, and combinations that overcome cortisol-driven immunosuppression are the main hope."],
